    "final_answer": "Coverage is complete with all required fields. Here is my final answer:\n\n## Final Answer\n\n**Yes, the queen-sized bedspread with a floral pattern is available in blue on Amazon.**\n\n### Product Found\n**Travan 3-Piece Quilt Set Quilted Bedspread Lightweight Coverlet Set — Garden Style Floral Printed Oversized Quilted Bedding Set with Shams for All Season, Exquisite, Queen Size**\n\n- **Size:** Queen ✓\n- **Pattern:** Floral Printed ✓\n- **Style:** Floral\n- **Rating:** 4.6 out of 5 stars (14,176 reviews)\n- **Price:** Starting at $49.99\n- **Status:** In Stock\n\n### Blue Color Availability\n**YES — Blue is available.** I confirmed at least the following blue color options on the product page:\n\n| Color Variant | Price | Stock |\n|---|---|---|\n| **B-misty Blue** | $49.99 | In Stock |\n| **D-blueocean** | $49.99 | In Stock |\n\n### Full List of Available Color/Pattern Options (visible)\n- Qs-exquisite ($49.99)\n- A-geometric Floral ($54.99)\n- A-grey ($54.99)\n- A-leaf Green ($49.99)\n- B-flower ($54.99)\n- B-leaf Green ($49.99)\n- **B-misty Blue** ($49.99) ← BLUE\n- Coreopsis-yellow ($64.99)\n- **D-blueocean** ($49.99) ← BLUE\n- D-flower ($64.99)\n- D-grey ($49.99)\n- N-orange Red ($49.99)\n\nAdditional color options appear off-screen in the swatch carousel (over 40 colors/patterns total per the listing summary).\n\n**Conclusion:** Amazon does offer this queen-sized floral bedspread in blue, with at least two distinct blue options (B-misty Blue and D-blueocean), both currently in stock.",
